   <|"Data" -> ".md\n## Better export to interactive HTML\nWe managed to make \
`Manipulate` work offline! Before it was only possible for custom dynamics or \
`ManipulatePlot` to function properly, since it does not involve dynamic \
frontend object creation. Now we turn off garbage collector before processing \
the notebook, let it accumulate objects and turn it back on after the \
exporting process has been finished.\n\nThe good news, you don't need to \
think about it. See it in action", "Display" -> "codemirror", 
    "Hash" -> "eb4bbdf4-e916-448a-8dbe-e8beac0b7eeb", "Invisible" -> False, 
    "MetaOnly" -> False, "Props" -> <|"Hidden" -> True|>, 
